   "as_of": "2026-10-19T11:08:02+05:30",
   "source_news_id": "nse-106821611",
   "text": "Company is developing a job-work model in which large customers supply the gold and it is paid for manufacturing services, expected to lower its gold inventory requirement and raise capacity utilisation."
  },
  {
   "as_of": "2026-10-19T11:08:02+05:30",
   "source_news_id": "nse-106821611",
   "text": "Lightweight plain gold jewellery is being added as a new focus area alongside its gemstone-studded and CZ-studded collections."
  },
  {
   "as_of": "2026-10-19T11:08:02+05:30",
   "source_news_id": "nse-106821611",
   "text": "Supply tie-ups with a few large corporate clients are at a preliminary stage with no definitive agreement, MoU or binding commitment executed."
  }
 ],
